UniSense is a clean, controller-style theme for the OPNsense web GUI,
inspired by UniFi OS: a dark navigation rail, card-based pages, quiet
tables and rounded controls.

It ships light, dark and automatic (follow the operating system) modes and
six accent colours, switchable from the top bar without a page reload.
Dashboard widgets, data grids, dialogs, legacy pages and the sign-in page
are all styled, and the theme makes no external requests.

